- Switch to a toolchain for your particular GPU backend. Information on this can be found at \ref tarch_logging.
- Consult the @ref  page_exahype_performance_optimisation "The code does not use all cores" discussion.
- @ref tarch::multicore "The multicore layer in the technical architecture"
