~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
::exahype2::fv::rusanov::sycl::RiemannSolverFused(..., targetDevice);
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

We see here, that SYCL can run on both the host and the device, whereas we pick
